      "created_at": "2015-01-21T10:59:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I also think it would be nice if the forum gave some notification when you get a new PM - on other sites I get a small pop-up window appearing whenever I enter the forum homepage and have a PM waiting for me. On here, I have to remember go into \"My Account\" and then \"Messages\" any time I want to check, so sometimes it's been a week or more before I've noticed someone has sent me a PM :(.</p>",
